## Default behaviour

- Default values are applied automatically when a parameter is not provided
- Agents SHOULD NOT explicitly pass parameters set to their default values unless required for clarity
- Boolean defaults follow Go zero-value semantics (`false` unless specified)
- String defaults are treated as literal values
